1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:02,573
A! Which one starts with A?

2
00:00:06,373 --> 00:00:07,855
Apple! A is for apple!

3
00:00:08,355 --> 00:00:10,056
Say it with me! A, apple!

4
00:00:13,356 --> 00:00:15,206
B! Which one starts with B?

5
00:00:19,006 --> 00:00:20,741
Banana! B is for banana!

6
00:00:21,241 --> 00:00:23,105
Say it with me! B, banana!

7
00:00:26,405 --> 00:00:28,213
C! Which one starts with C?

8
00:00:32,013 --> 00:00:33,294
Cat! C is for cat!

9
00:00:33,794 --> 00:00:35,434
Say it with me! C, cat!

10
00:00:38,734 --> 00:00:41,347
Last one! D! Which one starts with D?

11
00:00:45,147 --> 00:00:46,466
Duck! D is for duck!

12
00:00:46,966 --> 00:00:48,602
Say it with me! D, duck!

13
00:00:51,602 --> 00:00:55,612
A, B, C, D! You did it! Next time, E, F, G and H!

